- problem: "issue encountered"\n      status: "open|in_progress|resolved"\n     
resolution: "how it was fixed"\n```\n\n#### Memory Update Protocol\n1. **Before 
reading a file**: Check `recent_files` to avoid re-reading\n2. **After each 
action**: Update working memory immediately\n3. **Every 5 tool calls**: Review 
