Race condition in `record_delegation_errors`** (`agent.py`)\n  - TOCTOU race: 
two concurrent threads could both observe `not hasattr(self, 
"_delegation_tool_errors_lock")` → `True`, each create a new `threading.Lock()`,
and the second assignment would silently overwrite the first, losing all errors 
recorded by the first thread. Fixed by eagerly initializing 
`_delegation_tool_errors` and `_delegation_tool_errors_lock` in 
`Agent.__init__()`.\n- **BUG-3 🟡 MEDIUM — Double `FINISHED` event emitted per 
