smoke/            # Smoke tests\n├── ui_integration/   # UI integration 
tests\n└── empty_message_validation/  # Specialized validation tests\n```\n\n## 
Test Types\n\n### Unit Tests\n- Located in directories matching source structure
(e.g., `tests/agents/`, `tests/cli/`)\n- Test individual components in 
isolation\n- Use mocks for external dependencies\n\n### Integration Tests\n- 
Located in `tests/integration/`\n- Test interactions between components\n- May 
