`conftest.py`\n- Module-specific fixtures in local `conftest.py` files\n- Use 
`@pytest.fixture` decorator\n\n### Markers\n- `@pytest.mark.integration`: 
Integration tests that may call real APIs\n- `@pytest.mark.e2e`: End-to-end 
